# Nothing is required here any more.
#
# The app used to read an AppID from EXPO_PUBLIC_THEBUS_APP_ID, which meant the
# key was inlined into the bundle and extractable from the .ipa. From Increment
# 4 each user registers their own key at https://api.thebus.org/NewAccount/ and
# pastes it into the app on first launch; it is kept in the device keychain and
# never reaches the repository, the build, or this file.
#
# The file is kept so that anything reaching the app through the environment
# later has an obvious place to be documented -- and a reminder that such a
# value will be missing on a CI runner while working fine in Expo Go, which
# reads a local .env. That disagreement has cost this project three builds.
